    {
      "id": "VH-01",
      "status": "CLOSED-STATIC",
      "claim": "24A446 HTTP route appends X-Apple-ProtocolVersion for stup and info, formatted as unsigned integer from APSSystemGetUserVersion. The reviewed Android initial and video SETUP calls omit this extra header, while GET /info and update SETUP supply literal 1. This is a proven construction difference, not proof of vehicle rejection.",
